This project is a maintained fork of the chrono-tz workspace (`chrono-tz`,
`chrono-tz-build`, and `parse-zoneinfo`), kept API-compatible with the
`chrono-tz 0.10.4` release line and carrying IANA tzdb updates and security and
robustness fixes.

